# Claude Code status line — modes (presets). Managed via the configurator menu.
# format:  name|description|ON-keys (space separated; ALL = everything, NONE = nothing)
full|Everything on|ALL
work|Coding essentials — path, git, model, effort, context|SL_DIRECTORY SL_GIT SL_MODEL SL_FASTMODE SL_EFFORT SL_CONTEXT SL_CONTEXT_WARN SL_CLOCK SL_REMOTE
cost|Watch spend & rate limits|SL_DIRECTORY SL_MODEL SL_RATELIMIT_5H SL_RATELIMIT_7D SL_MODEL_LIMIT SL_BURNRATE SL_COST SL_COST_COLOR SL_CLOCK SL_REMOTE
minimal|Path, git, model, clock|SL_DIRECTORY SL_GIT SL_MODEL SL_CLOCK SL_REMOTE
focus|Just enough to stay oriented|SL_DIRECTORY SL_MODEL SL_EFFORT SL_REMOTE
zen|Nothing — a clean, empty line|NONE
